Source: mixtapes
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ackerman-00 <noreply@example.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cargo, rustc, meson, ninja-build, pkg-config,
 libglib2.0-dev, libgtk-4-dev, libadwaita-1-dev, libwebkitgtk-6.0-dev,
 libgstreamer1.0-dev, libgstreamer-plugins-base1.0-dev, libsqlite3-dev,
 libssl-dev, libdbus-1-dev
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/m-obeid/Mixtapes

Package: mixtapes
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
 yt-dlp, nodejs, gstreamer1.0-plugins-good,
 gstreamer1.0-plugins-bad, libgtk-4-1, libadwaita-1-0,
 libwebkitgtk-6.0-4
Recommends: ffmpeg
Description: Cross-platform YouTube Music client (GTK4, Libadwaita, GStreamer)
 Mixtapes is a cross-platform desktop application for streaming
 YouTube Music, built with GTK4, Libadwaita and GStreamer. The codebase
 was rewritten from Python to Rust in October 2026.
